  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Don't be a mind and you will know it and be it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.354422
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Meditation is no-mindedness.",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/12.mp3",
      "start": 3.634082,
      "end": 5.660159
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Mind is thinking, and thinking is going astray from the being.",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/13.mp3",
      "start": 6.88678,
      "end": 10.386349
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Mind is forgetfulness of \"that which is\".",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/14.mp3",
      "start": 11.53034,
      "end": 14.005056999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Meditation is coming back home.",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/15.mp3",
      "start": 15.194059000000001,
      "end": 17.007324
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "So, come back home.",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/16.mp3",
      "start": 18.090408,
      "end": 19.786259
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "And I create situations so that you may remember the forgotten, and I will go on creating situations until you have returned",
      "path": "audio/1971-270/17.mp3",
      "start": 21.016893,
      "end": 29.02
    }
  ]
}
